diff --git a/.changeset/browserbase-interactive.md b/.changeset/browserbase-interactive.md
new file mode 100644
index 00000000..bec35d49
--- /dev/null
+++ b/.changeset/browserbase-interactive.md
@@ -0,0 +1,7 @@
+---
+"effect-browser": minor
+"effect-browserbase": minor
+"effect-agent-browser": minor
+---
+
+Add shared browser automation for Chromium and Browserbase with scoped workflows, pinned targets, lazy capture streams and supervised agent tools. Move Chromium to `effect-browser/chromium` and agent integration to `effect-agent-browser`; tools receive browser sessions directly, and keyboard tools are explicitly opt-in. Browser Layers, `BrowserRuntime.make` and `Allocation.scoped` require Effect's `Crypto` from the host platform; the testing entry points supply a sequential one.
